title: "ecDNA-WGS-circdna: reproducible ecDNA detection from whole-genome sequencing"
abstract: >-
  A version-pinned, config-driven wrapper around nf-core/circdna for detecting extrachromosomal circular DNA (ecDNA) and other circular DNA from whole-genome sequencing.
type: software
